date-released: 2026-09-03
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementation and supporting materials for recursive multi-step
  forecasting performance evaluation and 10-year future sunspot number
  projections using the Additive Triple Long Short-Term Memory (ATri-LSTM)
  architecture. The repository includes a 10-run historical test-set
  forecasting experiment and a 40-run future-projection experiment.
keywords:
  - ATri-LSTM
  - LSTM
  - sunspot number
  - solar activity
  - space weather
  - time-series forecasting
  - recursive forecasting
  - MATLAB
